  1219	        // silently accepted here and then masked by the next `save`'s overwrite.
  1220	        // Even though Option 1 discards this op-log, validate its payloads now so
  1221	        // a corrupt sidecar fails LOUD on open (the No-Fallbacks contract this
  1222	        // increment promises). Done BEFORE `*self = ...` → atomic: a failure
  1223	        // leaves the session untouched and still usable.
