    71	    /// pre-recompute values and formula text. Cells that succeed have
    72	    /// their value replaced. Cells whose evaluation produces an Excel-
    73	    /// canon error value (`#DIV/0!`, `#VALUE!`, etc.) are counted as
    74	    /// succeeded — those error values are normal cell contents per
