   125	        // - *Codex H-1*: cycled cells are now written in a pre-pass
   126	        //   below, not lazily inside the eval loop. This matches
   127	        //   `recompute_dirty`'s cycle-first ordering (see line 3160+
   128	        //   below). Without the pre-pass, HashMap-order could
