   133	        // - *Codex H-2*: cycled-cell pre-pass also clears any
   134	        //   pre-existing spill anchor at the same address before
   135	        //   writing `#CIRC!`. Without this, an old `SEQUENCE(3)`
   136	        //   spill anchor that gets overwritten with a circular
   137	        //   formula leaves stale spill target overlays in A2/A3.
