   245	                    // in Phase 5 multi-peer collaboration: peer A
   246	                    // renames sheet `S → X`; peer B concurrently
   247	                    // writes `=S!A1+1`; merged log → B's formula
   248	                    // references the now-missing sheet `S`. Phase
   249	                    // 5.1 audit (Codex V5) verified the pre-fix
   250	                    // behavior was to leave the cell with its stale
   251	                    // pre-recompute value AND emit a
