   324	        // **W5-106 (Phase 4.7.M / task #136 closure)**: fixed-point
   325	        // loop. Each iteration:
   326	        //   1. claim + schedule the current dirty set.
   327	        //   2. snapshot prior + originally_dirty for newly-seen nodes
   328	        //      (carry across iterations so VEQ short-circuit still
   329	        //      works on second-iter D1's that depend on iter-1
   330	        //      formulas).

