   313	    /// workbook fully updated but the log without a corresponding
   314	    /// `BatchCommit` entry. Callers attaching an op log are expected to
   315	    /// treat this as an error condition (engine state has diverged from log
   316	    /// state) and abort recording — analogous to the "no fallbacks" rule.
